  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-001-jin043-leguang:friends" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-001-jin043-leguang:friends:m0000" ref="rlk_lzd_86c">王平子</persName>、<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-001-jin043-leguang:friends:m0004" ref="dfv_puq_icn">胡毋彦國</persName>諸人，皆以任放爲達，或有裸體者。</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-001-jin043-leguang:quote" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-001-jin043-leguang:quote:m0000" ref="591_360_8ca">樂廣</persName>笑曰：「名教中自有樂地，何爲乃爾也！」</p>
